---
description: >-
  Forward-position central connection (circle at the destination only,
  `->>()`) applied to the "normal" arrow family (solid, dotted, open,
  cross, close), with Alice as sender (left-to-right) -- part of a matched
  LTR/RTL pair.
config:
  sequence:
    diagramMarginX: 50
    diagramMarginY: 10
---
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Alice
  participant Bob
  participant Charlie
  Alice->>()Bob: Solid arrow with circle at destination
  Alice-->>()Bob: Dotted arrow with circle at destination
  Alice->()Bob: Open arrow with circle at destination
  Alice--x()Bob: Cross arrow with circle at destination
  Alice--)()Bob: Close arrow with circle at destination
